<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Oyahuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa bwabo ko Oyahuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oyahuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oyd</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa bwabo ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oyahuda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Oshu bwebe ko Oyahuda, oyole ko Oyesu Okristi, oyene ko Oyakubu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Gebe kawase ni Owuso yuwogwu ni, awase ni Owuso Ada ya yimu wa kweyi Oyesu Okristi ya gbeho wa ni:<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Iyinyinyi, omene kpimu ko Owuso na yo kpala sheyi gagye.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awofoza Kokame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Awoya hin moshi, ngbimu ko tokpa ikweyi kela ko olayi ni apye dudu ni, itikpi nwwa ma mo oshu koni nyya ta shini na talotugbagba shala takirikwu kotata ikweyi kotuse kaha ni Owuso yi nabo dawa ase nu ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ikweyi koni awase labi pa wule wipu kala ala ke gye lo. Awase ni akwobonu myuwoyi nekye-nekye ko yishi ni, agyo Owuso lo, aye eshi ko Owuso kaha pya wowe ko beba, kweyi atela ko Oyesu Okristi, Adole kase kpiri.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Koni ala kwobonu gyoza mani ni, nyya yimu ko rala mo ishi oye Adole ngmase nu bwokpagye ki Ijip, itikpi oke wa yawase ni kyogwu kpanu lo ni ngmo. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Ala rela ka ayoleho ni gweji koshu ni adawa ni ta kweyi shebe koyagye wa bita: Owuso yuwa gbo kpa ashirika ko gbogbo-gbogbo kweyi yuwa shonu gagye ipu kebe dibu ba gbeyi kepwo wa Eno nyakwu oni. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Rela ko Osodom kpo Ogomora, kpa awogya ni kuwa ni, ayoza ni ayoleho ko Owuso ya ni kweyi ba beba, ba yoza bibi: amowe ipu kola ko gbogbo-gbogbo, oni wa akpaha pyopyi dase kpiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Mamani, awase mani nana ni yuwa yikpiye wa yishi ni, atela koshu ko Owuso, kweyi asa ayoleho ki iso esa. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Omikel ni woteyi ka ayoleho ni ke ya mani lo. Ishini oya tawashu kpi Ibiri ikweyi ko okwu ko Omusa ni, Omikel tigiga tota ko si Ibiri esa lo, oke kela bibi oyoye ikweyi nu lo. Opa kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole na kyogwu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Awase mani ke ba sesa ikweyi koza ni agyikweyi nu lo ni kpoza ni otu wa kadawa ni; ale byebe kakyashi, awoza ni ba ngmuwa ni oma. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Igbe na tuwa! Agboso owe ko Okayinu. Ikweyi kimu kikwiri, abwo owe kigbo ni Obalam bwu ni. Aba ta saseyi byoni Okora ya ni, kweyi agekwu byoni ogekwu ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Awase mani kyapwapwa ebe kozarore kimya kala. Agbiweyi lo, awawogbeho kobize ni gyipu kiyiwa kin. Awowuso tobi ni ya towu yeye kweyi pasha, owuso ke yiwo lo. Awe efu kono ni gbo ogwogwa lo ni, efu ni ayi shu tonu ni, agekwu kyaga. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Alema byogwa ki ishu ni ya nyoza ni, oza kiweyi wa tese byoza ni ya kyowu ni. Ale byinyiwo ni nyowe ni, Owuso yebe dibu ni tobi shojoji ni tagye ya gbeyi wa. <verse eid="JUD 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enok ni wase ko omwahapa bwi ikweyi ka Adomu ni bane ikweyi kawase mani mo: &lt;&lt;Ma, Adole ya wa kpa ayoleho nu neshi okpaku okpaku nwashika, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kowa kepwo ikweyi kase kpiri, ko gbase ogo agye ikweyi kozalabi ni aya ni kpela bibi ni awinozalabi ka ikweyi nu ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Awase mani wawino kakyose kpawo mobibi kase; aba kimu koza bibi ni yotu wa ni; aba kiyiwa kweyi ba kase ashini shini ana pyoza ni aba yimu ni.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Awoya hin moshi, ala rela koza ni ayikoko ka Adole Oyesu Okristi kamo oya gbodagye ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Aka dala mo, &lt;&lt;Ishini okweyi kese yawa awase ni ba gboso imu kotu wa ni wa ko Owuso lo ni ba yaleye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Awa pini byikweyi koko wa la, awo yoza ni otu wa ka dawa ni, agbo Omaku ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ala ni ke wawoya hin moshi ni, ala gohobu ko miyikala giso ipu kotuse sere kala, kweyi ala tinarigwu ipu ko oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Ala bagye kala ipu kimu ko Owuso, ba gbeyi ka Adole ka Oyesu Okristi ipu kiyinyinyi nu ko dala olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ala miyinyinyi kawase ni ba kotu epepa ni; <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ala ngmase shishini shipu kola; ala miyinyinyi kase shishini nyabo kposhi yoya, ala ke tela kojoji, ko oshiye wa ni ikpiye kozalabi yi yishi ni.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inarigwu ko Sho Owuso Iye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Anu ni gboshu ko gbala shini ala ka gbo lo, kweyi ki byala wobutu nu kpo otunehe gboza kepwo lo, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Owuso oye kpokponu Inongmaha, bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi Adole kaha, igyashi, kpo oshu, bwo oyi kpiri ni shigbo ni, kpa anani, wakakanu ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>